/*⁣‌⁠⁠​⁠⁠⁠‌‍‍​​​⁠‍⁠‌‌​‍‍‍‌‌​‌⁠‍⁠⁠‍‌​⁠⁠‍⁠‌‍‌‍⁠​⁠⁠⁠⁠‍​⁠‍‍​​‌‍⁠‌⁠‍​​‌‍⁣ ============ 整体 ============ */
.xt-root {
  position: relative;
  max-width: 340px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 44px 0 12px;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 14px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  color: #333;
  overflow: hidden;
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "PingFang SC", "Helvetica Neue", "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
.xt-content {
  position: relative;
  padding: 0 18px;
  overflow: visible;
  border-top: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
}
.xt-text-mood { display: none !important; }

/* ====== 全局重置 ====== */
.xt-text-locPlace, .xt-text-locCity, .xt-text-locNote,
.xt-text-chatName,
.xt-text-visName, .xt-text-visHandle, .xt-text-visSign,
.xt-text-song, .xt-text-artist, .xt-text-lyric1, .xt-text-lyric2, .xt-text-lyric3,
.xt-text-todo1, .xt-text-todo2, .xt-text-todo3,
.xt-text-askName, .xt-text-askQ, .xt-text-askA, .xt-text-askViews,
.xt-text-rcptShop, .xt-text-rcptItem1, .xt-text-rcptPrice1,
.xt-text-rcptItem2, .xt-text-rcptPrice2, .xt-text-rcptItem3, .xt-text-rcptPrice3,
.xt-text-rcptTotal, .xt-text-rcptDate,
.xt-text-photoTime, .xt-text-photoLoc, .xt-text-photoDesc {
  background: none !important;
  background-color: transparent !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  min-height: 0 !important;
}

/* ====== 取消 ====== */
.xt-root::before {
  content: "取消";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0;
  width: 60px; height: 44px; line-height: 44px;
  padding: 0 0 0 18px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 500;
  color: #1a1a1a;
  background: #fff;
  z-index: 2;
}
/* 不再用 ::before 画线 — 改用 .xt-content 的 border-top */
.xt-content::before { content: none; }
/* ====== 发表 ====== */
.xt-root::after {
  content: "发表";
  position: absolute;
  top: 8px; right: 16px;
  padding: 5px 14px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600;
  color: #ffffff;
  background: #07c160;
  border-radius: 5px;
  z-index: 3;
}

/* ============ 想法 —— 自然撑高 ============ */
.xt-text-thought {
  margin-top: 14px;
  min-height: 110px;
  font-size: 15.5px;
  line-height: 1.72;
  letter-spacing: 0.2px;
  color: #2b2b2b;
  word-break: break-word;
}

/* ============ 配图 ============ */
.xt-image {
  position: relative;
  margin-top: 12px;
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
}
.xt-image img {
  width: 88px; height: 88px;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: #f2f2f2;
}
/* "+"格 */
.xt-image::after {
  content: "+";
  width: 88px; height: 88px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: #f7f7f7;
  border: 1px dashed #dedede;
  border-radius: 6px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 32px; font-weight: 200;
  color: #c8c8c8;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
/* 相册装饰图标（锚定 .xt-image，永远在"+"格右上角） */
.xt-image::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 166px; top: 2px;
